WEBVTT

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.786
And you know, I just thought I was right.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:05.956
AG: Apparently, Leah's parents
had had bad experiences with unions,

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:09.126
but obviously not everyone
agreed with her take.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:11.736
Her comment got a lot of attention.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:13.576
At some point, she googled her name,

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:18.566
and she saw herself referred to as
Leah "Unions suck dick" Finnegan.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:21.386
LF: That kind of haunts me,

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:26.139
that I might have a legacy
as a union buster,

00:10:26.163 --> 00:10:28.256
which is not great.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:31.331
In fact, unions do a lot of good